### Page 1 of 2

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

April 19, 2021
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #E-21-21 for furnishing One (1) New 2020-2021 Front End
Wheel Loader Mounted, Two Stage Blower, for the City of Cheyenne, Street and
Alley Division
______________________________________________
Two (2) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.

The Two (2) Bids were received from:
1. Power Equipment Company.  Casper, Wyoming.

2. Kois Brothers.  Commerce City, Colorado.

The bids were reviewed by Vicki Nemecek (Public Works), Craig LaVoy (Public Works), Randy
Hickman (Street & Alley), and Bryan Bell (Fleet Maintenance).
Their recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from Power Equipment Company,
for the purchase of One (1) New 2020-2021 Front End Wheel Loader Mounted, Two Stage Blower,
with and Acceptance of Trade-In Offer of Block #5900 (Snow Blast Blower), for a bid award
amount of $121,694.00.

Funding:
020-26-2616-42-43102 (1% Sales Tax 19-22 / Equipment / Street & Alley)
Total  $121,694.00
```

